    "content": "Pershing Square USA, Ltd. (PSUS) is a newly launched Delaware-based closed-end investment company managed by Bill Ackman’s Pershing Square Capital Management. It aims to provide a permanent capital model for investing in large-cap, North American-headquartered companies. The company is planning a combined IPO of PSUS shares and Pershing Square Inc. (PSI) in 2026, aiming to raise up to $10 billion.Key details about Pershing Square USA include:Initial Public Offering (IPO): As of April 2026, PSUS is conducting a dual IPO, where investors can purchase shares, with plans to list on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol \"PSUS\".Structure: Designed to be a listed closed-end fund, aiming to emulate a \"Berkshire Hathaway-style\" permanent capital structure to reduce redemption risks.Investment Goal: The fund intends to pursue long-term capital appreciation by investing in high-quality companies, often with significant operations in the United States.Management: Managed by Pershing Square Capital Management, L.P. (PSCM), with Bill Ackman as a key figure.Note: This refers to the financial entity \"Pershing Square USA Ltd.\", not the public park in Los Angeles.",
